      "writtenOn": "2024-02-27T23:23:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This seems like it could interfere with normal control over source/sink modes; for example this would break forcing discharge on AC. It doesn\u0027t seem like this is necessary in any case; does it still behave as expected if you don\u0027t do this?",
      "revId": "d21e06fdefc9c2f52105ff97bcf12e0798e9da62",
