      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-02-28T02:57:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For normal charge: 0x1c\u003d0x1, 0x1d\u003d0x47.\nFor discharge: 0x1c\u003d0x0, 0x1d\u003d0x40.\nAnd in this CL, it make idle: 0x1c\u003d0x1, 0x1d\u003d0x40.\n\nIf we don\u0027t enable sink mode back, the battery will discharge instead of idle.",
      "parentUuid": "dbfd9e2d_696cdaa1",
      "revId": "d21e06fdefc9c2f52105ff97bcf12e0798e9da62",
